[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Test Description
UID: DOC-TD
VERSION: 0.1.0
DATE: 2026-10-20

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Unit tests

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD001
TITLE: Age selects population
STATEMENT: test_age_selects_population shall show that age 18 is not pediatric and age 17 is pediatric.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD002
TITLE: Patients inherit from Human
STATEMENT: test_mock_patients_inherit_from_human shall show that each mock patient is a Human, the pediatric patient is age 8, and the sensor-fault patient has no numeric vitals.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD003
TITLE: Default profiles accepted
STATEMENT: test_default_profiles_are_accepted shall accept the adult and pediatric defaults and shall map age 18 to adult and age 17 to pediatric.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD004
TITLE: Reject SpO2 above 100
STATEMENT: test_rejects_spo2_above_100 shall reject an SpO2 low limit of 101.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD005
TITLE: Reject heart-rate order
STATEMENT: test_rejects_heart_rate_high_not_above_low shall reject a heart-rate high limit that is not above the low limit.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD006
TITLE: Reject temperature order
STATEMENT: test_rejects_temperature_high_not_above_low shall reject a temperature high limit that is not above the low limit.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD007
TITLE: Equal to limit
STATEMENT: test_equal_to_limit_does_not_alarm shall show that adult vitals equal to each limit do not alarm.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD008
TITLE: One past the limit
STATEMENT: test_one_past_adult_limits_alarms shall show that one step outside each adult limit raises that alarm.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD009
TITLE: Pediatric limits differ
STATEMENT: test_pediatric_limits_differ_from_adult shall show that SpO2 91 and heart rate 140 alarm differently on the adult and pediatric profiles.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD010
TITLE: Sensor fault unit
STATEMENT: test_sensor_fault_suppresses_vital_alarms shall show that an invalid sensor raises only SENSOR_FAULT.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS006

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Integration tests

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD011
TITLE: Healthy adult integration
STATEMENT: test_healthy_adult_reports_vitals_and_no_alarm shall present the healthy adult vitals unchanged, with the adult profile and no alarm.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD012
TITLE: Tachycardic adult integration
STATEMENT: test_tachycardic_adult_heart_rate_alarm shall raise only HEART_RATE for the tachycardic adult.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD013
TITLE: Hypoxic adult integration
STATEMENT: test_hypoxic_adult_spo2_alarm shall raise only SPO2 for the hypoxic adult.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD014
TITLE: Hypertensive adult integration
STATEMENT: test_hypertensive_adult_blood_pressure_alarm shall raise only BLOOD_PRESSURE for the hypertensive adult.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD015
TITLE: Pediatric integration
STATEMENT: test_pediatric_patient_uses_pediatric_profile shall select the pediatric profile and shall not alarm at heart rate 140.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD016
TITLE: Sensor fault integration
STATEMENT: test_sensor_fault_patient_hides_vitals shall hide numeric vitals and raise only SENSOR_FAULT.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS006

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD017
TITLE: Rejected limits integration
STATEMENT: test_rejected_limits_leave_the_adult_profile shall keep the adult profile after a rejected command and shall not alarm the healthy adult.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD018
TITLE: Idle and stopped integration
STATEMENT: test_idle_and_stopped_monitor_has_no_alarms shall report no alarms before start and after stop, and shall alarm only while running.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS004

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Software system tests

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD019
TITLE: System vitals
STATEMENT: test_system_reports_attached_vitals shall present the five healthy-adult vital values while monitoring is running.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD020
TITLE: System profile by age
STATEMENT: test_system_profile_follows_age shall apply the adult profile to the healthy adult and the pediatric profile to the pediatric patient.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS002

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD021
TITLE: System boundary
STATEMENT: test_system_boundary_value_does_not_alarm shall not alarm at heart rate 120 and shall alarm at heart rate 121 on the adult profile.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD022
TITLE: System start and stop
STATEMENT: test_system_start_and_stop shall reject start with no patient and shall clear alarms after stop.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS004

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD023
TITLE: System attach
STATEMENT: test_system_attach_stores_patient_and_profile shall store the pediatric patient and select the pediatric profile.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS005

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD024
TITLE: System sensor fault
STATEMENT: test_system_sensor_fault shall raise only SENSOR_FAULT and shall not present vitals as valid.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS006

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD025
TITLE: System rejected command
STATEMENT: test_system_rejects_out_of_range_command shall keep the previous limits and shall not alarm the healthy adult after a rejected command.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS007

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD026
TITLE: Fixture scope
STATEMENT: test_fixtures_are_function_scoped shall show that each required fixture is function scoped.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS008

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TD027
TITLE: HTML report configuration
STATEMENT: test_html_report_path_and_metadata shall show that the report path is docs/pytest-report.html, that the HTML is self-contained, and that version 0.1.0, the device configuration, the tools, and the operator are recorded.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS009

[[/SECTION]]
